[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=27 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="堤道晚上要挂灯，所有人都来问能不能借第五队的灯油。弗莱彻没有马上答应，先让管事说挂几盏、挂多久、明早还要不要用同一批灯芯。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="管事"

speaker_name=""

text="不是过节。就是等几条晚船回来，黑的时候桥口分不清。孩子们偏要做灯罩，看着才像你们说的过节。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="做灯罩可以，别把名字写得比灯孔还大。上次风把纸贴回灯面，整条桥都只亮“阿”字。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="一个女孩把手里的纸翻过来，原本准备写的一行字露出来。她说想写一个已经搬去别处的朋友，不是等她回来，只想让她要是路过，也能看见。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="知道她现在在哪儿吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="女孩"

speaker_name=""

text="知道，北边。写信很慢，有时候收到了，前一封还在路上。她说住高一点就不用总搬床了，我想看看她的新窗户。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你本来又差点把这盏灯理解成悼念。女孩说起新窗户时很高兴，拿尺在纸上比它的宽，抱怨朋友把尺寸写错了，不然自己可以提前做一块窗帘寄去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="那你写窗帘的尺寸在里面，外面留一点光。她未必看得见这盏灯，总能看见你之后的信。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="莫里坐下来帮忙折纸。她手比说话耐心，纸破了先补，再让孩子试着自己折，不用“你太小”把所有工作都收走。你在旁边削灯芯，第一根削短了，没人嫌弃，拿去放低的那盏。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我也能做一个？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="做啊。又没收报名费。想写名字就写，不想写就画，别为了证明自己有过去，硬编一个人往上放。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你拿着纸想了半天，最后画了两条并在一起的线。一条长一点，一条转弯不太顺，不是某种神秘标记，只是今天回接维修艇时留在脑海里的样子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="像面条。你是不是饿了？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这是航路。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="好吧。那它们吃完饭再出发。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把图重新画宽一点，德雷顿帮你捏住边角。纸在灯光下很薄，补过的地方反而更亮。莫里看了一会儿，说这次她承认能看出来不是面条。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="油够挂到最后一条船进港。有人负责看，不让孩子碰。剩下那份明早还给船上，别等真要用才发现都亮完了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="管事"

speaker_name=""

text="明白。还你们新的灯芯，旧的我留着做引火。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="晚船来的时候，没有音乐，也没人讲一段总结今天的演说。大家忙着辨灯号、解绳、把热饭递过去。女孩把给朋友的信夹在值班桌旁，怕忙过头忘记寄。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="明天这些灯就收起来？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="不然一直挂着，下雨破了还得我们补。好看的东西也得会收，才有下回。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_21"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把自己的纸罩晾干，折平放进空卡后面。它不能解释你的来历，却记着你在这里做过的一件没有被要求、也没有特殊作用的东西。回船的路上，德雷顿问你汤想喝咸一点还是淡一点，你想了一会儿，说淡一点。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_22"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="好，今天又知道一件了。别明早为了迎合莫里，说自己从小就爱吃咸的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_23"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你说记住了。海风把最后一盏灯吹偏，负责值守的人抬手扶正，灯光落在桥上，让后面那条走得慢的船，也能清楚看见该靠向哪边。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

